  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional and technical support for REDD+ readiness in West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This GCF Readiness proposal will support the targeted countries to overcome challenges and address barriers by strengthening their institutional and technical capacities to develop REDD+ Warsaw framework to become REDD+ ready and mobilize the funding required in the Land Use, Land Use Change and Forestry (LULUCF) sector. This Readiness proposal will also exchange knowledge and lessons learned to strengthen countries? West Africa engagement in climate mitigation action.</narrative>
  </description>
